    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rotten Forgotten</strong>: <i>A Whimsical Farm Revival Adventure.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends and embark on a delightful agricultural escapade in Rotten Forgotten, a charming <strong>cooperative</strong> <strong>farming</strong> game for <strong>1-4 players</strong>. Your once-thriving family barn teeters on the brink of bankruptcy, and it's up to you and your companions to breathe new life into the dilapidated homestead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate a variety of quirky crops, tend to your eclectic menagerie of farm animals, and race against time to fulfill orders and save your beloved barn from financial ruin. With a perfect blend of strategy, teamwork, and lighthearted fun, Rotten Forgotten is perfect for <strong>playing</strong> <strong>with</strong> <strong>friends</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/ffab723ca82613099d50c4d0c09ae6ba.poster.avif?t=1738689104\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/ffab723ca82613099d50c4d0c09ae6ba.webm?t=1738689104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/ffab723ca82613099d50c4d0c09ae6ba.mp4?t=1738689104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging <strong>co-op gameplay</strong> for solo farmers or groups of up to four players. Play with <strong>keyboard</strong> and/or <strong>controllers</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging <strong>time management</strong> as you juggle crop cycles and animal care.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plant!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/3fd81caf501d50d7776e033550381ff5.poster.avif?t=1738689104\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/3fd81caf501d50d7776e033550381ff5.webm?t=1738689104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/3fd81caf501d50d7776e033550381ff5.mp4?t=1738689104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic <strong>farming</strong> activities including digging, watering, and nurturing plants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maneuver around stubborn <strong>obstacles</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Care!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/bce278f76ef7dc0809f9d0357b281bb6.poster.avif?t=1738689104\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/bce278f76ef7dc0809f9d0357b281bb6.webm?t=1738689104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/bce278f76ef7dc0809f9d0357b281bb6.mp4?t=1738689104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for your animals: feed them, milk them, and trim them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and utilize <strong>power-ups</strong> to boost your farming prowess.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Protect!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/6732169538353bdba5846e3e040d1dbc.poster.avif?t=1738689104\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/6732169538353bdba5846e3e040d1dbc.webm?t=1738689104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370480/extras/6732169538353bdba5846e3e040d1dbc.mp4?t=1738689104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect</strong> your farm from pesky <strong>wildlife</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome unexpected <strong>power-downs</strong> that add an extra layer of challenge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you and your friends turn your forgotten farm into a thriving agricultural wonderland, or will your efforts be left to rot? The fate of your family legacy is in your hands in this heartwarming tale of rural redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your tools and prepare for a harvest of laughter and excitement in Rotten Forgotten \u2013 where every withered plant and hungry animal is an opportunity for teamwork and triumph!</p>",
